cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-TDVRPTW-Rifki2020
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the Rifki2020 TDVRPTW benchmark adaptation, generated routing attributes and FIFO-restored travel-time representation. Also cite Rifki, Chiabaut and Solnon (2020) for the underlying Lyon travel-time data and Malandraki and Daskin (1992) for the FIFO transformation. Record the exact Git commit used.
